# Builtin: LessEqualFact.OrderSignFromNegativeLiteralBound
# When: known `a <= k` / `a < k` with resolved k < 0 (or right-bound form).
# Proves: `a <= 0` at verify time (no eager infer).
# Run: litex -f examples/new_pipeline/proof_nodes/order/order_sign_from_negative_literal_bound.lit

have a R
trust a <= -1
a <= 0
